      "id": 5,
      "options": {
        "content": "# Live Operational Monitoring vs Batch Reporting\n\nThis dashboard displays **Live Application Metrics** exposed by the FastAPI prediction endpoint. \n\n**Note**: Complex data validations like **Concept/Data Drift** and **Fairness Monitoring** are computed in batch mode to avoid slowing down live predictions and because they require aggregations over time/groups. \nThese reports are available in `reports/` and are logged to MLflow during scheduled batch runs.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "10.0.3",
      "transparent": true,
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
